{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden Retriever Simple Life is a wholesome game about the bond you share with your furry friend. It features hours of high quality videos of an adorable (he really is!) real-life Golden Retriever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096810/extras/624d027e981f7590f32101367d76a1d4.poster.avif?t=1772364959\" width=1080 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096810/extras/624d027e981f7590f32101367d76a1d4.webm?t=1772364959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096810/extras/624d027e981f7590f32101367d76a1d4.mp4?t=1772364959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live day-to-day, deciding what's your next step on your adventure with your dog, teaching new tricks, discovering new places and socializing with other dogs. Spend your days at your own pace, creating memories that last a lifetime.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of high quality videos featuring a real-life Golden Retriever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time management: decide what to do at each moment of the day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new locations and discover hidden paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach new tricks. Start simple, then move on to more complicated exercises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right balance between your dog's obedience, happiness and other social stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your friend, purchase new toys and keep them healthy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste